helvb08 (FlipCTL)
=================

This font is based on `u8g2_font_helvB08_tf` from the
[u8g2](https://github.com/olikraus/u8g2) project, which is itself derived from
the X11 **Adobe Helvetica Bold** bitmap font:

    -Adobe-Helvetica-Bold-R-Normal--11-80-100-100-P-60-ISO10646-1

Flipper Devices added extra glyphs (the FlipCTL additions). The whole thing is
distributed under the original X11-style Adobe/DEC permissive license, which
allows use, modification, distribution and sale — commercial use included —
provided the copyright notices are kept.

    Original bitmap : Adobe Systems Incorporated (1984, 1987)
                      Digital Equipment Corporation (1988, 1991)
    Source          : u8g2 (olikraus/u8g2), font u8g2_font_helvB08_tf
    FlipCTL glyphs  : Flipper Devices Inc., 2026

SPDX / reference: X11-Style (Adobe-DEC)
https://scancode-licensedb.aboutcode.org/x11-adobe-dec.html

